    "detailed_description": "&quot;Fortress of the Undead&quot; is a thrilling zombie survival game that will transport you to a post-apocalyptic fortress in Norway, where you'll need to fight off hordes of undead monsters in order to survive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nAs a player, you'll need to scavenge for weapons and ammo in order to defend yourself against the relentless zombie attacks. You'll need to use all your wits and skills to survive for as long as possible, working together with up to 4 players to stay alive in this dangerous fortress.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWith a wide range of weapons and equipment at your disposal, you'll need to fight your way through hundreds or thousands of zombies, using strategic thinking and quick reflexes to stay alive.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nSo if you're ready for a heart-pumping adventure full of danger and excitement, then &quot;Fortress of the Undead&quot; is the game for you. Get ready to fight for your life - and may the strongest survive!",
